                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Nobody crosses my wind bridge unseen - the whole span is open sky and I ride the updraft above it. I marked you the moment you set foot on the planks. Settle it here, over the drop, where nerve counts."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Salamence has thrown better challengers than you off worse ledges. Show me you keep your footing when the wind wants you gone."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You wear the founder-face the old sky-lodges toast in secret. I do not care whose ghost you are. I care whether you can battle on a bridge."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Cassia Stormrider",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
